      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMLS1088A Embedded Octal Cortex-A53 Module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on Arm® Octal Cortex®-A53 and NXP LS1088A processor</h1>\r\n<p>The TQMLS1088A is an embedded Octal Cortex-A53 module based on the LS1088A processor from NXP, designed for various applications, including networking and industrial automation. It features QorIQ Trust Architecture and Arm TrustZone for advanced security, making it suitable for secure data processing. With support for IEEE 1588 and QUICC Engine, the TQMLS1088A embedded Octal Cortex-A53 module ensures precision timing and efficient communication. Despite its high-speed communication capabilities via Gigabit Ethernet, PCIe, and USB 3.0 interfaces, it maintains low power consumption. Additionally, its extended temperature range and compact dimensions enhance its suitability for diverse environments.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 16 2026 15:19:45 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
